{
  "id": "rua-direita",
  "name": "Rua Direita",
  "notes": [
    "AUTHORING COORDINATES: s = tx+ty (screen DEPTH, y = s*8), dd = tx-ty (screen",
    "HORIZONTAL, x = 320 + dd*16). A street runs along constant s, so it is a BAND:",
    "{sFrom, sTo, ddFrom, ddTo}. Buildings give frontS (the s of their street-facing",
    "corner) + dd; a terrace is a chain of buildings whose dd spans [dd-w, dd+d] abut.",
    "Changing frontS moves a building UP/DOWN the screen without changing its screen",
    "x span — that is how the terrace is staggered without breaking the packing.",
    "VERTICAL BUDGET (640x360 native): sky 0-84 | distant town 58-112 |",
    "far terrace 24-190 | five-foot way 155-190 | STREET 190-308 |",
    "near pavement 308-364 | near roofs 262-360 (the foreground occluder plane).",
    "SCALE MARKERS: player 32, doorway 40, storey 48, stall canopy 40, arcade pier 36."
  ],
